  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU4 PFM -  BA2022AAP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main impact of this Action is to improve the public financial management in Bosnia and Herzegovina in the part concerning the strengthening of operational capacities and digitalization in order to ensure functional public financial management systems which observes the EU recommendations in this field. In ensuring so, the action will focus on strengthening revenue mobilization and improve business environment.The Action will increase the overall efficiency of the revenue collection system through strengthening indirect taxation by introduction and implementation of new procedures and EU best practices.</narrative>
  </description>
